# ==========================================
# Root .gitignore for Urban Transit System
# Covers: ASP.NET Core (C#) & React/Vite/Node
# ==========================================

# --- OS-specific files ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
$_ANDI_
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# --- IDEs / Editors / User-specific configurations ---
.vs/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp
*.bak

# --- Node / React (transit-client) ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/build/
**/*.local
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/lerna-debug.log*
**/package-lock.json.bak

# --- .NET Core / ASP.NET (TransitApi) ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/App_Data/
**/*.gpState
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

# Backup / publish directories
**/publish/
**/out/

# --- SQLite Databases ---
# Excluding SQLite database backup/temporary files but keeping the main transit.db
# if it is tracked as the default seeded SQLite database for this project.
# To completely ignore transit.db, uncomment the line below:
# **/transit.db
